WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.289
Your XP now adds up to a level, from one to thirty, and the header shows it on every

00:00:07.289 --> 00:00:07.981
screen.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.063
Each level has a threshold: level two at four hundred XP, level eight at two

00:00:15.063 --> 00:00:19.988
thousand six hundred, level nineteen at ten thousand four hundred. The rest are

00:00:19.988 --> 00:00:22.720
provisional until the table is settled.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.730
The mid rider reads level seven, eighteen forty of twenty-six hundred, the bar

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:36.140
seventy point eight percent full. Tap it for Profile. On a phone, only the badge.

00:00:38.714 --> 00:00:43.284
Every ride answers with the level it reaches and whether it went up. At level

00:00:43.284 --> 00:00:46.730
thirty, the XP keeps growing and the level stays put.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.773
What the tests prove: every row of the table, the level through the API, and the

00:00:53.773 --> 00:00:55.730
header as the rider sees it.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:03.965
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:08.821
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:08.821 --> 00:01:10.492
every hill and interval.

00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:16.016
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:16.016 --> 00:01:21.464
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:21.464 --> 00:01:24.454
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:24.799 --> 00:01:27.291
A custom workout lives under Profile.
